WEBVTT

00:05:58.482 --> 00:06:01.077
Never before in the history of mankind

00:06:01.101 --> 00:06:04.433
has it been easier to reach
millions of people around the globe

00:06:04.457 --> 00:06:06.124
in a few seconds.

00:06:06.148 --> 00:06:10.093
What is posted on social media
spreads so quickly,

00:06:10.117 --> 00:06:14.053
becomes viral and excites the minds
of people all around the globe.

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:16.514
Before it is deleted,

00:06:16.538 --> 00:06:18.471
it is often already too late.

00:06:18.966 --> 00:06:21.196
Millions of people
have already been infected

00:06:21.220 --> 00:06:23.077
with hatred and anger,

00:06:23.101 --> 00:06:25.831
and they either become active online,

00:06:25.855 --> 00:06:28.998
by spreading or amplifying hatred,

00:06:29.022 --> 00:06:32.815
or they take to the streets
and take up arms.